<title>USA: SC&amp;T gets $3 mln jury verdict.</title>
<headline>SC&amp;T gets $3 mln jury verdict.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>SC &amp; T International Inc said it received a $3,000,000 jury verdict in a trade secrets misappropriation and breach of contract case against Maxi Switch Inc of Tucson, Ariz., Silitek Corp of Taipei, Taiwan and Lite-On Peripherals Inc of Milpitas, Calif.</p>
<p>SC&amp;T filed suit in May 1995, alleging misappropriation of trade secrets related to SC&amp;T's multimedia keyboards, marketed under SC&amp;T's trade name, Platinum Sound.</p>
</text>
